OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly rain quickly clearing
OL,6,Feastwards leaving a brighter, fresher-
OL,7,Ffeeling day for many, with some warm
OL,8,Fsunny spells and a north-westerly
OL,9,Fwind. Cloudier at times in the north
OL,10,Fand west, with isolated showers
OL,11,Fpossible.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with further showers
OL,14,Fover western and northern hills,
OL,15,Felsewhere mostly dry with clear
OL,16,Fspells. Wind easing light inland but
OL,17,Fbreezy near the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
