OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FStaying cloudy with the odd
OL,6,Flight shower over western hills
OL,7,Fhowever elsewhere will be mostly dry
OL,8,Fwith bright or sunny spells. Moderate
OL,9,Fwesterly breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,12,Fchangeable period, with nearer-normal
OL,13,Ftemperatures than of late as showers
OL,14,For longer spells of rain move through,
OL,15,Finterspersed with brighter, drier
OL,16,Finterludes. Often breezy, with
OL,17,Foccasionally strong winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
